          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot me mony, Lubaŋa pa Icrael, owacci, “Abeketo can i kom Amon, ma en lubaŋa me Tebec, kacel ki Ejipt ki lwak lubaŋane ki lukerre ducu. Abeketo can i kom Parao kacel ki jo ducu ma gigeno eno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimiyogi i cin jo ma mito nekogi, abimiyogi i ciŋ Nebukadnejar kabaka me Babilon ki luditone, Ento lacen dano dok gibibedo i Ejipt aye, kit macalo yam gubedo i kare ma okato con. An a Rwot me mony doŋ aloko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.26"
            ]
          }
        }
